From b9cc8784e46c0b786b66d14bd348113bef5ed4e9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "keepup[bot]" <keepup[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 22 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat: add GPT-6 Sol and GPT-6 Luna to the OpenAI fallback
 model list

OpenAI released gpt-6-sol and gpt-6-luna on 22 Sep 2026. AnythingLLM offers
this fixed list whenever its call to OpenAI's live model list fails, and
neither model was in it, so nobody on that path could pick them.

The OpenAI provider also sends temperature on every chat. OpenAI's GPT-6
guide says to remove temperature when reasoning effort isn't none, and this
provider never sets an effort, so requests for gpt-6 models now leave it out.
Older models keep what they send today.

Replay date: 22 Sep 2026
Source: https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/changelog (22 Sep entry)
Source: https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/latest-model
